Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember the feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,warm but uneasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,new home, new city,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:01:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,low self-esteem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.94,0:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I took pill after pill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.22,0:03:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,just to quiet my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,then smoked by the window
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and stayed in my bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropped acid alone while
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the ceiling turned strange
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and waited for something
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,inside me to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My dealer knew
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,when I needed a spark,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and I called that friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,because it was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At sixteen, I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I had years left to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At seventeen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I had habits to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't miss the fear
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,or the things I went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss being young enough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,not to know what they'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My first love came
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,through that apartment door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I had never let anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.58,0:03:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,that close before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept the opioids
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,hidden where nobody would see,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,took more than I intended
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.84,0:03:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and kept it all with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I overdosed in silence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,with the bedroom door shut tight,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then woke up hours later
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:03:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and said that I was alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know what was wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,or why I hated my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.48,0:04:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I only knew the pills could cut
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the pressure down within.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't call it good,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't call it bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.36,0:04:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It held some of the worst
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and the best that I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now when I remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I hated those years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but I still miss sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Newark is traffic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I pass on the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,but part of me stays
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,in that bedroom some days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,a story to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:06:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't miss that bedroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,at least not completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but sometimes I miss
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,what it meant to be sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.11,0:06:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember the feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.46,0:06:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,warm but uneasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,a new home, a new city,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,a life in between.
